{"id":"6360e1eff68a99fe","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-complexity.md","title":"Solovay Reducibility Bounds Both C and K","display":"thm-solovay-complexity — Solovay Reducibility Bounds Both C and K","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-complexity","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-complexity"],"display":"thm-solovay-complexity — Solovay Reducibility Bounds Both C and K","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-df-complexity-red]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 13.2.4 and Theorem 13.2.5","source_printed_pages":"341","source_pdf_pages":"361","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-complexity — Solovay Reducibility Bounds Both C and K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 13.2.4 and Theorem 13.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"341"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"361"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in(0,1)\\)</span> 为左 c.e. 实数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\">\\(\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\">\\(\\beta=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists i,j\\ge N\\;(X(i)=0\\land Y(j)=0)\">\\(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists i,j\\ge N\\;(X(i)=0\\land Y(j)=0)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 作用于实数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_C,\\le_K\">\\(\\le_C,\\le_K\\)</span> 作用于展开序列，见相应定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_C,\\le_K\">\\(\\le_C,\\le_K\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\to X\\le_C Y\\land X\\le_K Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\to X\\le_C Y\\land X\\le_K Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同长二进有理数相差常数倍 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span> 时，两者描述复杂度只差固定常数；用归约的有效误差控制取得这样的近似。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 13.2.4 and Theorem 13.2.5；印刷页 341，PDF 页 361。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]，$\\le_C,\\le_K$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]，$\\le_C,\\le_K$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists i,j\\ge N\\;(X(i)=0\\land Y(j)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_C,\\le_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_C,\\le_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\to X\\le_C Y\\land X\\le_K Y.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false}],"bytes":1581,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-complexity]] — Solovay Reducibility Bounds Both C and K"},{"id":"39d4d75d292f4550","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40","9d68ed64bfec741d"]}